## 10. Sync discipline — worktree → runtime

Edits in worktrees with `runtime_mirror:` are auto-synced by the `post_tool_call` hook.

**Manual fallback:**
```bash
{% for wt in worktrees %}{% if wt.runtime_mirror is defined and wt.runtime_mirror %}cp worktree/{{ wt.name }}/<file> {{ wt.runtime_mirror }}/<file>
rm -f {{ wt.runtime_mirror }}/<dir>/__pycache__/<file_stem>.cpython-*.pyc
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
```
